  "body": "Immaculate 1970s brick apartment, perfectly positioned just moments from the vibrant heart of Mission Bay, the beachfront, cafés, restaurants, and scenic waterfront walks. \r\n\r\nWhether you're downsizing, buying your first home, investing, or seeking a secure coastal retreat, this beautifully presented residence offers the ideal blend of comfort, convenience, and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned upstairs at the rear of an impeccably maintained boutique block of only four apartments, this elevated home enjoys excellent security and a sun-filled north-west aspect that floods the living spaces with natural light.\r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless modern living, the spacious open-plan layout flows seamlessly from the stylish gourmet kitchen through to the generous living and dining areas, extending onto a private balcony - perfect for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\n\r\n• Excellent lock-up-and- leave lifestyle\r\n• Short scenic drive to the City\r\n• Approx 101m² of spacious floor area\r\n• Large open-plan living and dining area\r\n• Dedicated study nook for working from home space\r\n• Two generous double bedrooms with excellent storage\r\n• Contemporary gourmet kitchen with quality appliances\r\n• Modern bathroom with both a separate bathtub and shower\r\n• Secure lock-up garage\r\n• Solid brick construction and new roof for lasting peace of mind\r\n• Convenient to public transport\r\n\r\nEnjoy the very best of Mission Bay living - where the beach, cafés, and coastal lifestyle are right on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nThis is beachside living at its finest.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
